WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.433
That's right. The times when he is forced to use his power

00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:12.300
are the most exhilarating parts in this anime.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.900
The number of abilities he can use is limitless.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.100
Ta-da!

00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:20.600
Hi, it's N-ko!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:24.333
This week's The N-ko Show has started.

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:27.833
It has been really hot lately.

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:34.600
When it's hot, to make myself feel cool from the inside,

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:36.933
I eat a lot of food

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:41.000
that is in season in summer, like vegetables and fruits.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.366
For example, I absolutely love somen noodles.

00:00:44.366 --> 00:00:49.633
Somen noodles are very thin, white, er…

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.466
noodles.

00:00:51.466 --> 00:00:52.866
(Usually eaten chilled)

00:00:52.866 --> 00:00:56.500
I would cut rolled omelet into thin strips,

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:58.700
and julienne cucumbers,

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:03.500
and I love eating it with ginger and Japanese ginger.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:09.600
To my surprise, many foreign people can't slurp noodles,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.766
so when I have somen noodles with friends from foreign countries,

00:01:13.766 --> 00:01:18.400
I would give them a lecture on how to slurp noodles.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:19.666
It's so hot now,

00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:26.200
so let's eat a lot of food that will make the body feel cool from the inside.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.700
Well then, let's start this week's The N-ko Show!

00:01:31.733 --> 00:01:34.100
Weekly Favorites!

00:01:35.266 --> 00:01:40.700
I will share my recommendations based on my personal preference again.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.200
This is the theme.

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:44.600
It's perfect in summer!

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:47.133
Exhilarating Anime!

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:52.966
Everyone, what is the thing you want when summer comes?

00:01:52.966 --> 00:01:54.833
Hmm, ice cream?

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:56.966
Sea bathing.

00:01:56.966 --> 00:01:59.233
A cool, well air-conditioned room.

00:01:59.233 --> 00:02:00.633
All right.

00:02:00.633 --> 00:02:04.700
So to answer to your requests,

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:11.300
I'll recommend anime that will make you feel refreshed just by watching them.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:12.966
This is the first one.

00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.533
CELLS AT WORK!

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:18.233
It personifies cells that make up the human body,

00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:24.933
and the anime depicts how the cells work for the body every day.

00:02:24.933 --> 00:02:27.233
Although it's our own bodies,

00:02:27.233 --> 00:02:34.166
we don't have many chances to realize what our cells do for us.

00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:38.433
But in this anime, the cells themselves are personified,

00:02:38.433 --> 00:02:41.533
the work and the roles played by each kind of cell

00:02:41.533 --> 00:02:46.433
are replaced by scenes that are like parts of our daily life,

00:02:46.433 --> 00:02:50.533
so it's an anime that's easy to understand, and educational.

00:02:50.533 --> 00:02:53.300
What makes this anime exhilarating is

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:57.500
the process of cells killing things

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:01.433
that are harmful to our body, like viruses and bacteria.

00:03:01.433 --> 00:03:05.233
Influenza, heatstroke, cancer cells…

00:03:05.233 --> 00:03:08.433
They are risks that might happen to us.

00:03:08.433 --> 00:03:12.500
Seeing how the cells continue to fight bravely with them

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.200
is very exhilarating.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:16.100
After you finish watching the anime,

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:22.233
it makes you want to first thank your cells for working for you,

00:03:22.233 --> 00:03:29.133
and you'll unconsciously eat and drink something healthier than usual.

00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:32.633
You can learn about your own body in this anime,

00:03:32.633 --> 00:03:35.466
and it's exhilarating, so I recommend it.

00:03:35.466 --> 00:03:37.366
Next, it's this one.

00:03:37.366 --> 00:03:40.000
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME.

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.900
Because of an unfortunate event,

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:46.500
Rimuru Tempest is reincarnated in a different world as a slime,

00:03:46.500 --> 00:03:50.866
and he goes on an adventure with his friends in this anime.

00:03:50.866 --> 00:03:52.400
Speaking of slimes,

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:57.366
they are the weakest monsters we're familiar with in RPG games.

00:03:57.366 --> 00:03:59.733
Being reincarnated as a slime,

00:03:59.733 --> 00:04:05.100
you may wonder about the protagonist's unfortunate circumstance,

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:09.333
but he has the power of defense that cancels attacks by the enemies,

00:04:09.333 --> 00:04:10.966
the power of disguise,

00:04:10.966 --> 00:04:14.900
and he can engulf an enemy and analyze them.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:19.500
The number of abilities he can use is limitless.

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:25.166
The battles where he uses his many powers to defeat enemies

00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:27.800
are very much worth watching.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.400
To begin with, a slime is so weak,

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:35.233
so seeing one defeating enemies that are supposed to be stronger than him

00:04:35.233 --> 00:04:37.233
is extremely exhilarating.

00:04:37.233 --> 00:04:43.000
This anime takes advantage of the impression of slimes being the weakest,

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.900
please do watch it.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:46.933
Last but not least, it's this one.

00:04:46.933 --> 00:04:48.700
MOB PSYCHO 100.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:52.900
The protagonist, Shigeo Kageyama possesses psychic power,

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.700
and people call him Mob.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:57.600
He gets involved in various cases,

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:01.133
and the way he grows as a person is depicted

00:05:01.133 --> 00:05:03.766
in this youth gag battle anime.

00:05:03.766 --> 00:05:09.266
The psychic power Mob possesses is one of the world's most powerful,

00:05:09.266 --> 00:05:11.933
but he wants a normal life so much,

00:05:11.933 --> 00:05:15.233
that he never uses it eagerly.

00:05:15.233 --> 00:05:17.000
His psychic power aside,

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.466
he sucks at sports and is troubled by love.

00:05:20.466 --> 00:05:25.966
Being a dull, ordinary middle school student is one of his characteristics.

00:05:25.966 --> 00:05:30.866
However, because his power is too strong,

00:05:30.866 --> 00:05:37.066
cult groups and spirits gather around Mob.

00:05:37.066 --> 00:05:42.200
That's right. The times when he is forced to use his power

00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:46.100
are the most exhilarating parts in this anime.

00:05:46.100 --> 00:05:48.666
Mob's face is usually unexpressive,

00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:51.733
but the more excited he gets,

00:05:51.733 --> 00:05:53.800
the closer his emotions come to exploding.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:56.400
When his anger explodes, he is like a different person,

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.933
and the strongest Mob emerges.

00:05:59.933 --> 00:06:05.700
By the way, Mob is surprisingly cool after his anger explodes,

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.366
and it's worth noting.

00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:09.466
The anime I introduced today

00:06:09.466 --> 00:06:13.866
are packed with parts that make you feel good and exhilarated,

00:06:13.866 --> 00:06:16.566
so please do watch them.

00:06:16.566 --> 00:06:19.566
That's it for Weekly Favorites.

00:06:20.466 --> 00:06:22.200
N-ko English.

00:06:22.966 --> 00:06:27.933
In this segment, I will share how to say anime quotes in English.

00:06:27.933 --> 00:06:32.300
This time, I'll also share an anime quote you'll want to use

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:33.800
whenever you get the chance.

00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:35.766
Well then, let's begin.

00:06:36.266 --> 00:06:38.566
This is today's quote.

00:06:39.366 --> 00:06:42.566
"It's okay to run away from things you don't want."

00:06:43.166 --> 00:06:47.166
It's okay to run away from things you don't want.

00:06:47.166 --> 00:06:50.433
Right before Mob's stress level rose to 100 percent,

00:06:50.433 --> 00:06:53.966
Mob's mentor said that to him.

00:06:53.966 --> 00:06:58.200
Mob's mentor is positive about running away from something he doesn't want,

00:06:58.200 --> 00:07:01.466
his open-mindedness makes me have a crush on him.

00:07:01.466 --> 00:07:03.733
A little tip on pronunciation.

00:07:03.733 --> 00:07:05.000
Say "run away,"

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.700
pause a little and say,

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:09.233
"from things you don't want."

00:07:09.233 --> 00:07:13.066
After you say "run away," pause a little,

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.266
then "from things you don't want."

00:07:15.266 --> 00:07:18.900
The point is to stress that it's okay to run away,

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:22.800
so accentuate the "it's okay to run away" part,

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:25.400
then say, "from things you don't want."

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.000
If you say it like this,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:31.733
I think it's going to make it sound cooler.

00:07:31.733 --> 00:07:34.766
Please do try to use this quote.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.366
That's it for N-ko English.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:41.833
N-ko's Q &amp; A!

00:07:41.833 --> 00:07:46.400
I will answer your questions again this week.

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:48.833
Let's start.

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:50.800
This is the first question.

00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.666
"If you had a whole day off,

00:07:52.666 --> 00:07:56.933
would you be able to watch an entire anime in one day?"

00:07:56.933 --> 00:07:59.033
Of course, I can.

00:07:59.033 --> 00:08:01.300
I have done this before.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:04.866
When I was quite little,

00:08:04.866 --> 00:08:08.133
I was quite a weak lamb.

00:08:08.133 --> 00:08:13.933
I was often sick and had to take days off from school.

00:08:13.933 --> 00:08:18.333
Then I would watch anime throughout the day.

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:22.466
And I once had influenza when I was in college.

00:08:23.066 --> 00:08:25.366
When I had the flu,

00:08:25.366 --> 00:08:31.500
I got better in two, three days after I took medicine,

00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:38.133
although I couldn't go to school for seven to ten days.

00:08:38.133 --> 00:08:42.533
So I watched YU YU HAKUSHO during that time.

00:08:42.533 --> 00:08:48.866
I watched the hundreds of episodes of the series in one go.

00:08:48.866 --> 00:08:53.533
I am a sheep who quite likes watching a whole series in one go.

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:54.833
Okay, next question.

00:08:54.833 --> 00:08:59.866
"What's some anime merchandise you've been wanting to get your hands on lately?

00:08:59.866 --> 00:09:02.600
For me, it's been DRAGON BALL figurines."

00:09:04.733 --> 00:09:08.966
In the past, it was figurines,

00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:11.466
acrylic stands,

00:09:11.466 --> 00:09:13.166
acrylic key holders.

00:09:13.166 --> 00:09:15.366
I loved collecting those.

00:09:15.366 --> 00:09:18.100
But I am 24 years old now,

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:20.733
and I am a grown-up sheep,

00:09:20.733 --> 00:09:26.366
so now, it's something I can use in daily life,

00:09:26.366 --> 00:09:29.233
something that uses an anime as the motif,

00:09:29.233 --> 00:09:32.733
such as Blu-ray, DVD, and posters.

00:09:32.733 --> 00:09:37.833
My interest in merchandise has shifted to those.

00:09:37.833 --> 00:09:42.866
I sometimes buy T-shirts that don't look like anime T-shirts at a glance.

00:09:42.866 --> 00:09:47.266
Or I would want posters that look stunning,

00:09:47.266 --> 00:09:51.800
and I want to have luxurious boxes of Blu-ray or DVD.

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:55.833
Those are what I've been buying lately.

00:09:55.833 --> 00:09:57.433
Okay, next question.

00:09:57.433 --> 00:10:05.333
"If you appear in an anime, what story do you think it will be?"

00:10:05.333 --> 00:10:09.833
I think it'd be kind of similar to AGGRETSUKO.

00:10:09.833 --> 00:10:16.100
AGGRETSUKO is the story of an ordinary red panda working at an office.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:21.566
I am also a sheep-human lifeform working at an office,

00:10:21.566 --> 00:10:25.600
so it would be an anime that talks about my work.

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:30.300
I think it will be an anime about the daily life of a sheep office worker.

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:35.866
But if I were to become the protagonist of a fantasy anime,

00:10:35.866 --> 00:10:38.366
maybe I'll fly in the sky

00:10:38.366 --> 00:10:41.933
or possess some kind of mysterious power,

00:10:41.933 --> 00:10:46.600
accompanied by a mysterious creature,

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.366
and do something in a mysterious world.

00:10:49.366 --> 00:10:55.100
I want to become the protagonist of an anime full of elements of fantasy.

00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:56.500
Okay, next question.

00:10:56.500 --> 00:11:00.366
"Could you tell me why you have the sheep-form, N-ko?

00:11:00.366 --> 00:11:03.733
What is the relationship between sheep and Netflix?"

00:11:03.733 --> 00:11:07.166
I have the sheep-form because

00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:10.433
I am a sheep-human lifeform.

00:11:10.433 --> 00:11:13.733
This is the only answer I can give you.

00:11:13.733 --> 00:11:17.966
If there's any relationship between sheep and Netflix,

00:11:17.966 --> 00:11:22.000
it's just like how you count sheep before you sleep.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:27.600
I hope you can open Netflix and enjoy its contents before you sleep.

00:11:27.600 --> 00:11:29.933
I think it's also what I wished for,

00:11:29.933 --> 00:11:33.800
with regard to the relationship between me and Netflix.

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.200
Okay, next question.

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:39.466
Someone said they are curious about the names of my pets.

00:11:39.466 --> 00:11:45.333
The names of my dogs are Lucky, Lulu, Leo, Luke, and Hana-chan.

00:11:45.333 --> 00:11:49.300
The names of my cats are a little complicated.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:52.533
They have two names, the real name and a nickname.

00:11:52.533 --> 00:11:57.833
I call them their nicknames more often than their real names.

00:11:57.833 --> 00:12:01.266
Genpachi and Shino are their real names,

00:12:01.266 --> 00:12:07.500
their nicknames are Beibei and Bibi.

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:10.133
My sugar glider's name is Teto,

00:12:10.133 --> 00:12:11.833
my chinchilla's name is Yona.

00:12:11.833 --> 00:12:14.866
Those are the names of my pets.

00:12:14.866 --> 00:12:19.000
Thank you for your various questions this time, too.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:22.866
I'm still waiting for you to send me your questions.

00:12:22.866 --> 00:12:26.266
That's it for N-ko's Q &amp; A.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:33.133
The N-ko Show! It's now time to say goodbye.

00:12:33.133 --> 00:12:38.333
Today's theme has been "feeling exhilarated."

00:12:38.333 --> 00:12:44.600
I think we want to feel refreshed every day in summer.

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:48.400
The other side of an automatic door is often cool.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:53.133
So like how an air-conditioned space can make you feel refreshed,

00:12:53.133 --> 00:12:55.766
I hope you're going to find something

00:12:55.766 --> 00:12:59.500
that makes you feel refreshed in your daily life.

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.333
So the thing I'll do before next week.

00:13:02.333 --> 00:13:09.133
I think there are many more exhilarating anime in the world,

00:13:09.133 --> 00:13:12.833
so I'll continue to look for their exhilarating elements

00:13:12.833 --> 00:13:15.333
when I watch the anime.

00:13:15.333 --> 00:13:19.066
Let's meet again next time!

00:13:19.066 --> 00:13:20.466
See you!

